00:36:40,100 --> 00:36:44,100
So if you like this first introduction to photonics course

691
00:36:44,100 --> 00:36:48,100
and you would like to further expand your knowledge

692
00:36:48,100 --> 00:36:49,100
in the area of photonics,

693
00:36:49,100 --> 00:36:51,100
there's three other courses

694
00:36:51,100 --> 00:36:53,100
that are being offered through laser tech

695
00:36:53,100 --> 00:36:55,100
and then in the River State College

