723
00:38:20,100 --> 00:38:23,100
In this course you're going to learn about optical fibers,

724
00:38:23,100 --> 00:38:26,100
how they are made out of,

725
00:38:26,100 --> 00:38:28,100
and then also how they are being used.

726
00:38:28,100 --> 00:38:31,100
You are also going to learn how to install the connector

727
00:38:31,100 --> 00:38:34,100
