728
00:38:34,100 --> 00:38:39,100
and then also how to perform different types of measurements

729
00:38:39,100 --> 00:38:43,100
including the Tier 1 measurement using OLTS

730
00:38:43,100 --> 00:38:47,100
and also Tier 2 using optical time domain reflectometer

731
00:38:47,100 --> 00:38:51,100
or popularly known as OTDR.

732
00:38:51,100 --> 00:38:54,100
The practical aspect of this course is also very important

733
00:38:54,100 --> 00:38:58,100
where you're going to have an opportunity

734
00:38:58,100 --> 00:39:00,100
to work on industrial equipment

735
00:39:00,100 --> 00:39:05,100
such as different types of measurement tools

736
00:39:05,100 --> 00:39:10,100
made by the manufacturers that are used

737
00:39:10,100 --> 00:39:14,100
in the actual field of fiber optic technology.

738
00:39:14,100 --> 00:39:18,100
Finally, the course titled Laser Technologies

739
00:39:18,100 --> 00:39:23,100
is an advanced level course in laser systems.

740
